            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Royal Bullets](item_3dee6c30-86d8-4d60-b877-4d78b6a6da7c) is a must, and the entire build relies on it. Try to get a feel for the proc range \u2014 that\u2019s the range you should aim to stay in during fights.\n\n## Items\n\nPick up [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for WP, [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) for AP, and [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) in most cases since you\u2019ll be meleeing frequently. The alternative would be [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318). [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) scales better past R1.",
