            "notes": "## Items\n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Gutpunch Gauntlet](item_00e8f6f5-20c3-49da-a85a-bafcbc3afb56) offer the highest WP you can get. The secondary effect of [Gutpunch Gauntlet](item_00e8f6f5-20c3-49da-a85a-bafcbc3afb56) isn't important but is useable.\n\nYou can add a few optional items depending on how much cash you have. I usually go with [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2).",
