            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Reckoner\u2019s Roar](item_efe615c6-8b32-4847-9d8f-4f55adaeba52) gets you to around 250 HPS if you hit 3 targets or so. Don\u2019t use this before taking damage or unless you're already being pushed aggressively. Just be mindful of anti-heals, you need to play around them if there are any. Try to use it when [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) stacks are at 5 from [Royal Bullets](item_3dee6c30-86d8-4d60-b877-4d78b6a6da7c).\n\n## Items\n\n[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) has an interesting interaction with [Royal Bullets](item_3dee6c30-86d8-4d60-b877-4d78b6a6da7c): if you trigger [Royal Bullets](item_3dee6c30-86d8-4d60-b877-4d78b6a6da7c), [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) will instantly go to max stacks, which is 25% AP.\n\nThis is also the first round where I\u2019ll sometimes buy [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) against heroes like Ana, Moira, or Ashe, who debuff or completely shut down your healing. Immobilization is also a big threat from heroes like Ana, Mei, or Moira. If needed, you can sell [Gutpunch Gauntlet](item_00e8f6f5-20c3-49da-a85a-bafcbc3afb56) to afford it.\n\n[Dez's Damage Dampeners](item_d55fc98b-d014-4383-903c-a7aa1fb7c619) is decent VS Lucio and Brig.",
