            "notes": "## Items\n\nVery simple \u2014 just sell [Gutpunch Gauntlet](item_00e8f6f5-20c3-49da-a85a-bafcbc3afb56) (or keep it if you have enough cash), then get [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b). Fill the last slot with a green or blue item if you have the cash, like [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318). With more cash [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) or keeping [Gutpunch Gauntlet](item_00e8f6f5-20c3-49da-a85a-bafcbc3afb56).\n\nIf you don\u2019t have a lot of cash, keep [Gutpunch Gauntlet](item_00e8f6f5-20c3-49da-a85a-bafcbc3afb56) and buy [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27), which is virtually the same but uses an extra slot.",
