            "notes": "## Items\n\nIf you don\u2019t have a defensive item yet, this round you should get one in most games. The one I recommend is [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8), as explained in the round before.\n\nIf you're ahead or there are no healing debuffs to worry about, you can go for more damage with some of the optional items. The one you should buy by replacing [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) is [El-sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100).\n\nIf you're short on cash, pick up [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) instead.\n\n[Bloodhound Mask](item_6d47a293-5ec7-44ca-b4c5-120204757c14) or [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) are also solid picks if you want even more damage and have the cash for it. Just keep in mind these are win-more items.",
